e: 12pt;\">Candidates are suggested to download the admit card &amp; save the pdf file for the future reference.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can download the Result also from the official website of UKPSC.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UKPSC PCS Online Form 2024 : Exam Center</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: inherit; font-weight: inherit;\">Almora, Ranikhet, Champavat, Pithorgarh, Nainital, &nbsp;Ramnagar, Haldwari, Rudrapur, Kashipur, &nbsp;Khatima, Bageshwar, Podi, Shrinagar, Kotdwar, Gopeshwar, Karn Prayag, New Tehri, Narendra Nagar, Rudraprayag, Uttar Kashi, Badhkot, Dehradun, Vikasnagar, Rishikesh, Haridwar, Luxar and Roorkee.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UKPSC PCS Recruitment 2024 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Prelims Written Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Mains Written Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Personal Interview</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><st